OL,13,G0855 Heir Hunters
OL,14,     FWhen a lift attendant's Leeds home
OL,15,     Fgoes up for auction, the team
OL,16,     Funravel the family history of her
OL,17,     Fgrandad, who worked his way up
OL,18,     Fthrough society to become a top
OL,19,     Fchauffeur.
