OL,5,G1000 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition kicks off at The
OL,7,     FKing's Head in Addlethorpe, where
OL,8,     Fhospitality queen Helen Coy holds
OL,9,     Fcourt. A funfair game of
OL,10,     Fhook-a-duck takes the guests back
OL,11,     Fto their childhoods.
OL,12,G1035 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe second visit is to the
OL,14,     Fdog-friendly Beck Hall in North
OL,15,     FYorkshire, where B&B newbies
OL,16,     FLouise and Andy Macbeth get a
OL,17,     Fgrilling, and one of the guests
OL,18,     Fgoes green around the gills.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
