OL,5,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FAvid souvenir collectors Kevin and
OL,7,     FJulie Shadbolt welcome their
OL,8,     Frivals to The Albaston in Torquay.
OL,9,     FSome of the guests are startled by
OL,10,     Ftheir menagerie of memorabilia.
OL,11,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe final visit is to Hotel
OL,13,     FPiccadilly in Bournemouth, a dance
OL,14,     Fholiday venue run by Terri and
OL,15,     FStewart. But while the female
OL,16,     Fguests give it a whirl, the boys
OL,17,     Fappear to have two left feet...
