OL,5,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,7,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,8,     Ffor one last time to find out how
OL,9,     Fmuch they've been paid and settle
OL,10,     Fsome scores, before the winner is
OL,11,     Fannounced.
OL,12,G1240 Come Dine with Me
OL,13,     FEastbourne. Accident-prone trainee
OL,14,     Fteacher Kirsty Davenport hosts
OL,15,     Fwith a simple menu and some
OL,16,     Fcreative entertainment. But have
OL,17,     Fthe group already tired of
OL,18,     FRussell's constant jokes? (Ep1/5)
