OL,12,G1750 George Clarke's Old House New Home
OL,13,     FGeorge takes on a classic 1930s
OL,14,     Fterraced home with a tiny kitchen
OL,15,     Fand two mismatched fireplaces, and
OL,16,     Frevisits a Victorian home that he
OL,17,     Fpreviously helped renovate.
