OL,5,G1855 Location, Location, Location
OL,6,     FIn Bristol, will Kirstie's cheeky
OL,7,     Ftactic work on first-time buyers
OL,8,     Fand nest flyers Jesse and Cameron?
OL,9,     FAnd Phil helps basketballer Andrea
OL,10,     Fslam dunk a place in Bath for her
OL,11,     F#400k.
OL,12,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FIdentical twins Nik and Jon are
OL,14,     Fbuilding near-identical houses in
OL,15,     FSheffield. Raised on steel stilts,
OL,16,     Fthese two extraordinary properties
OL,17,     Fpay tribute to the city's
OL,18,     Findustrial past.
